    "body": "@domenic According to the HTML specification, an H4 heading may be followed by an H2 heading, so the current example is logically incorrect, but semantically correct. In my example, an H1 is followed by an H3, which would be logically halfway correct, but semantically wrong, because an H2 would have to be used instead of the H3. I ask not to close my PR, but to merge it.\r\n\r\nSee your [own comment](https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8366#issuecomment-1271444505).",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
