    "updated_at": "2023-03-28T04:22:56Z",
    "body": "> I don't understand how you're using the words \"logically\" or \"semantically\". \r\n\r\n* logically: Heading structure according to the content of the heading (Apples should be parent to Taste because Taste is a property of Apples).\r\n* semantically: Heading structure according to the level of headings (numbers 1 to 6)",
